{c: Verse 1}
[Em],        Dil Ke Jharoke Mein Tujko Bithakar
[Em],        Yadoon Ko Teri Maein Dulhan Banakar
[A] [D],        Rakhoonga Maein Dil Ke Paas
[C] [D] [Em],        Mat Ho Meri Jaan Udaas,
Dil Ke Jharoke...        [Em]
Kal Tere Jalwe Paraye Bhi Honge,        [D]
Lekin Jhalak Mere Khwabon Mein Hogi,        [Bm]
Phoolon Ki Doli Mein Hogi Tu Rukhsat,        [C] [Em]
Lekin Mehak Meri Sanson Mein Hogi,        [Em]
Ab Bhi Tere Surkh Hothon Ke Pyale,        [D]
Mere Tassavur Mein Saki Baney Hain,        [Bm]
Ab Bhi Teri Zulf Ke Mast Saye,        [C] [Em]
Birha Ki Dhoop Mein Sathi Baney Hain,        Dil Ke Jharoke...
[Em],        Meri Mohabbat Ko Thukra De Chahe
[D],        Maein Koi Tujhse Na Shikva Karoonga
[Bm],        Aankhon Mein Rehti Hai Tasveer Teri
[C] [Em],        Sari Umar Teri Pooja Karoonga,
Dil Ke Jharoke...
